OL,3,GNEWSA'Just for fun' shanty singers
OL,4,Aprogress to album release
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We're five mates who drink beer and
OL,7,Fsing shanties."
OL,9,FA group of shanty singers from the Isle
OL,10,Fof Wight who got together just for fun
OL,11,Fin 2023 have become so popular they are
OL,12,Freleasing an album.
OL,14,FPete Badham is a member of five-piece
OL,15,Fgroup East Cowes Shanty.
OL,17,F"It started when one of the members of
OL,18,Fthe sailing club asked if anyone
OL,19,Ffancied starting a shanty group. I went
OL,20,Fto see what it was about and we were
OL,21,Frubbish. But we gradually built up to
OL,22,Fwhere we are now", Badham explained.
